sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisites: n/a<br>Configuration State: N/a<br>Memory State: N/a<br>Reusable States: N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to change the availability of a Connector to Inoperative.

    CSMS->>CS: ChangeAvailabilityRequest (operationalStatus = Inoperative, evse.id, evse.connectorId)
    Note over CSMS: Validation (Step 1): ChangeAvailabilityRequest<br>- operationalStatus Inoperative<br>- evse.id <Configured evseId><br>- evse.connectorId <Configured connectorId>

    CS-->>CSMS: ChangeAvailabilityResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 3: The Test System notifies the CSMS about the current state of the connector
    CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Unavailable, evseId = <Configured evseId>, connectorId = <Configured connectorId>)
    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = "Unavailable", component.name = "Connector", component.evse.id = <Configured evseId>, component.evse.connectorid = <Configured connectorId>, variable.name = "AvailabilityState")

    CSMS-->>CS: CSMS responds accordingly (StatusNotificationResponse / NotifyEventResponse)
